async function request(path,data){if(path!=='/api/printers') {if(data)data={printer:selectedPrinter,...data};else path=scoped(path)}const r=await fetch(path,{method:data?'POST':'GET',headers:data?{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Control-Token':token}:{},body:data?JSON.stringify(data):undefined,signal:AbortSignal.timeout(path.startsWith('/api/print-plan')?60000:path.startsWith('/api/history')?30000:12000)});const value=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(value.error||'Printer request failed');return value}
function statusBadge(element,state){element.dataset.state=state||'unknown';element.textContent=({standby:'Ready',ready:'Ready',printing:'Printing',paused:'Paused',complete:'Completed',cancelled:'Cancelled',error:'Error',offline:'Offline',unavailable:'Unavailable',connecting:'Connecting…'})[state]||state||'—';element.classList.toggle('offline',['offline','unavailable'].includes(state))}
function toast(message){text('toast',message);$('toast').hidden=false;setTimeout(()=>$('toast').hidden=true,5500)}
function buttons(){controlButtons();const toggle=$('pauseResume'),action=state==='paused'?'resume':'pause';toggle.dataset.action=action;iconLabel(toggle,action==='resume'?'play':'pause',action==='resume'?'Resume':'Pause');toggle.disabled=busy||!online||!['printing','paused'].includes(state);$('cancel').disabled=busy||!online||!['printing','paused'].includes(state);document.querySelectorAll('.targetform input,.targetapply').forEach(e=>e.disabled=busy||!online);document.querySelector('[data-action="emergency_stop"]').disabled=busy||!online;document.querySelectorAll('.start').forEach(b=>b.disabled=busy||!online||['printing','paused'].includes(state))}
async function poll(gen=pollGeneration,pushed=null){if(gen!==pollGeneration)return;try{const data=pushed||await request('/api/status');if(data.error)throw Error(data.error);if(gen!==pollGeneration)return;const s=data.status,p=s.print_stats||{},v=s.virtual_sdcard||{},e=s.extruder||{},b=s.heater_bed||{};online=true;state=p.state||'unknown';text('connection','● Connected');$('connection').classList.remove('offline');$('error').hidden=true;statusBadge($('jobstate'),state);text('filename',p.filename||'No active print');updateJobPreview(p.filename||'',p.plateindex||'');const progress=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,v.progress||s.display_status?.progress||0));text('progress',`${Math.round(progress*100)}%`);$('fill').style.width=progress*100+'%';text('elapsed',time(p.print_duration));text('remaining',state==='printing'&&progress>.02?time((p.print_duration||0)*(1-progress)/progress):'—');text('layer',p.info?.current_layer?`${p.info.current_layer} / ${p.info.total_layer||'—'}`:'—');renderTemperatures(data.temperatures||[]);renderControls(s,data.controls||[]);renderBox(s);text('position',(s.toolhead?.position||[]).slice(0,3).map(x=>number(x,0)).join(' · ')||'—');text('speed',Number.isFinite(s.gcode_move?.speed_factor)?Math.round(s.gcode_move.speed_factor*100)+'%':'—');liveFilamentLength=p.filament_used;updateFilamentGrams(p.filename||'');text('printerAddress',`${data.printer.name} · ${data.printer.url} · Moonraker`);text('updated',new Date().toLocaleTimeString());history.push({at:Date.now(),values:Object.fromEntries(temperatureModels.map(r=>[r.id,r.actual])),readings:Object.fromEntries(temperatureModels.map(r=>[r.id,{actual:r.actual,target:r.target,power:r.power}]))});history=history.filter(x=>Date.now()-x.at<300000);draw();}catch(e){if(gen!==pollGeneration)return;online=false;text('connection','● Offline');$('connection').classList.add('offline');text('error','Printer connection unavailable: '+e.message);$('error').hidden=false;for(const id of ['progress','elapsed','remaining','layer','position','speed','filament'])text(id,'—');statusBadge($('jobstate'),'unavailable');$('fill').style.width='0%';text('updated','Connection lost');}finally{if(gen===pollGeneration){buttons();if(!streamConnected)setTimeout(()=>poll(gen),3000)}}}

function renderTemperatures(rows){temperatureModels=rows;loadTemperaturePreference();const signature=JSON.stringify([selectedPrinter,rows.map(r=>[r.id,r.editable,r.min,r.max])]);const body=$('temperatureRows');if(signature!==temperatureSignature){temperatureSignature=signature;body.replaceChildren();for(const r of rows){const row=document.createElement('tr');row.dataset.heater=r.id;const name=document.createElement('td');name.className='heatername';iconLabel(name,'temperature',r.name);const power=document.createElement('td');power.className='power';const actual=document.createElement('td');actual.className='actual';const target=document.createElement('td');if(r.editable){const form=document.createElement('form');form.className='targetform';form.dataset.heater=r.id;const field=document.createElement('div');field.className='targetfield';const input=document.createElement('input');input.type='number';input.min='0';input.max=r.max;input.step='1';input.required=true;input.value=Number.isFinite(r.target)?r.target:0;input.setAttribute('aria-label',r.name+' target temperature');input.title='0 (off) or '+r.min+'–'+r.max+'°C'+(r.configured_limit?'':' (dashboard limit)');input.oninput=()=>{input.dataset.dirty='true'};const unit=document.createElement('span');unit.textContent='°C';field.append(input,unit);const apply=document.createElement('button');apply.type='submit';apply.className='targetapply';apply.setAttribute('aria-label','Apply '+r.name+' target');iconLabel(apply,'check','');form.append(field,apply);form.onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!online||busy)return;if(!input.checkValidity())return input.reportValidity();const target=Number(input.value);if(target!==0&&target<r.min){toast('Target must be 0 or at least '+r.min+'°C');return}confirmAction({action:'heat',heater:r.id,target},'Set '+r.name+' temperature?',target===0?'Turn off '+r.name+' on '+(printerList.find(p=>p.id===selectedPrinter)?.name||'this printer')+'?':'Set '+r.name+' to '+target+'°C on '+(printerList.find(p=>p.id===selectedPrinter)?.name||'this printer')+'?')};target.append(form)}else{target.className='readonly';target.textContent='—';target.title='Temperature sensor only'}row.append(name,power,actual,target);body.append(row)}}for(const r of rows){const row=[...body.children].find(e=>e.dataset.heater===r.id);row.querySelector('.actual').textContent=number(r.actual)+'°C';row.querySelector('.power').textContent=Number.isFinite(r.power)?(r.power>0?Math.round(r.power*100)+'%':'off'):'—';const input=row.querySelector('input');if(input&&!input.dataset.dirty&&document.activeElement!==input&&!(pending?.action==='heat'&&pending.heater===r.id))input.value=Number.isFinite(r.target)?r.target:0}applyTemperatureVisibility();if($('temperatureSelect').open&&temperatureChoiceSignature!==temperatureSignature)renderTemperatureChoices();}
function draw(){const canvas=$('chart'),rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect(),dpr=window.devicePixelRatio||1;const pixelWidth=Math.round(rect.width*dpr),pixelHeight=Math.round(160*dpr);if(canvas.width!==pixelWidth||canvas.height!==pixelHeight){canvas.width=pixelWidth;canvas.height=pixelHeight}const c=canvas.getContext('2d');c.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);c.clearRect(0,0,rect.width,160);const w=rect.width,chosen=temperatureModels.filter(temperatureVisible),left=38,right=w-8,top=12,bottom=136,now=Date.now();const values=history.flatMap(p=>chosen.map(r=>p.values?.[r.id])).filter(Number.isFinite);const max=Math.max(50,...values)+10;c.font='10px system-ui';c.textAlign='left';c.lineWidth=1;c.strokeStyle='#334036';c.fillStyle='#a2afa5';for(let i=0;i<4;i++){const y=top+(bottom-top)*i/3;c.beginPath();c.moveTo(left,y);c.lineTo(right,y);c.stroke();c.fillText(Math.round(max*(1-i/3))+'°',0,y+3)}c.fillText('5m ago',left,157);c.fillText('Now',Math.max(left,right-24),157);for(const r of chosen){c.strokeStyle=temperatureColor(r.id);c.lineWidth=2;c.beginPath();let connected=false;for(const p of history){const value=p.values?.[r.id];if(!Number.isFinite(value)){connected=false;continue}const x=left+(right-left)*(1-(now-p.at)/300000),y=bottom-value/max*(bottom-top);if(connected)c.lineTo(x,y);else c.moveTo(x,y);connected=true}c.stroke()}if(hoverAt!==null){const point=history.reduce((best,p)=>!best||Math.abs(p.at-hoverAt)<Math.abs(best.at-hoverAt)?p:best,null);if(point){const x=left+(right-left)*(1-(now-point.at)/300000);c.strokeStyle='#a2afa5';c.lineWidth=1;c.setLineDash([4,4]);c.beginPath();c.moveTo(x,top);c.lineTo(x,bottom);c.stroke();c.setLineDash([]);renderChartTooltip(point,chosen)}}if(!chosen.length){c.fillStyle='#a2afa5';c.textAlign='center';c.fillText('Select temperatures to display the graph',w/2,78)}}
function loadTemperaturePreference(){if(temperaturePreferencePrinter===selectedPrinter)return;temperaturePreferencePrinter=selectedPrinter;selectedTemperatures=null;try{const value=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('temperatureSelection:'+selectedPrinter));if(Array.isArray(value))selectedTemperatures=new Set(value.filter(v=>typeof v==='string'))}catch{}}
function temperatureVisible(r){return selectedTemperatures===null||selectedTemperatures.has(r.id)}
function temperatureColor(id){if(id==='extruder')return '#c7ee78';if(id==='heater_bed')return '#efb26d';const colors=['#76c7ee','#d996ed','#f18a9f','#75dec1','#e3d16c','#96a9fa','#edabdf','#9ada86'];let hash=0;for(const ch of id)hash=(hash*31+ch.charCodeAt(0))>>>0;return colors[hash%colors.length]}
function applyTemperatureVisibility(){for(const row of $('temperatureRows').children){const model=temperatureModels.find(r=>r.id===row.dataset.heater);if(model)row.hidden=!temperatureVisible(model)}let empty=$('temperatureRows').querySelector('.temperatureempty');const chosen=temperatureModels.filter(temperatureVisible);if(!chosen.length&&!empty){empty=document.createElement('tr');empty.className='temperatureempty';const cell=document.createElement('td');cell.colSpan=4;cell.className='muted';cell.textContent=temperatureModels.length?'No temperatures selected. Use Select temperatures to show them.':'Waiting for temperatures…';empty.append(cell);$('temperatureRows').append(empty)}else if(chosen.length&&empty)empty.remove();const legend=$('chartLegend'),legendSignature=JSON.stringify(chosen.map(r=>[r.id,r.name]));if(legend.dataset.signature===legendSignature)return;legend.dataset.signature=legendSignature;legend.replaceChildren();for(const r of chosen){const label=document.createElement('span');label.className='legenditem';const swatch=document.createElement('span');swatch.className='legendswatch';swatch.style.background=temperatureColor(r.id);swatch.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');label.append(swatch,document.createTextNode(r.name));legend.append(label)}}
function saveTemperaturePreference(){try{localStorage.setItem('temperatureSelection:'+selectedPrinter,JSON.stringify([...selectedTemperatures]))}catch{toast('Temperature choices could not be saved in this browser')}applyTemperatureVisibility();draw()}
function renderTemperatureChoices(){temperatureChoiceSignature=temperatureSignature;const container=$('temperatureChoices');container.replaceChildren();if(!temperatureModels.length){container.textContent='Connect to the printer to choose temperatures.';return}for(const r of temperatureModels){const label=document.createElement('label');label.className='temperaturechoice';const check=document.createElement('input');check.type='checkbox';check.checked=temperatureVisible(r);check.onchange=()=>{if(selectedTemperatures===null)selectedTemperatures=new Set(temperatureModels.map(r=>r.id));if(check.checked)selectedTemperatures.add(r.id);else selectedTemperatures.delete(r.id);saveTemperaturePreference()};const swatch=document.createElement('span');swatch.className='legendswatch';swatch.style.background=temperatureColor(r.id);swatch.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');const name=document.createElement('span');name.textContent=r.name;const type=document.createElement('small');type.textContent=r.editable?'Heater':'Sensor';label.append(check,swatch,name,type);container.append(label)}}
$('selectTemperatures').onclick=()=>{renderTemperatureChoices();$('temperatureSelect').showModal()};$('closeTemperatureSelect').onclick=()=>$('temperatureSelect').close();$('showAllTemperatures').onclick=()=>{selectedTemperatures=new Set(temperatureModels.map(r=>r.id));saveTemperaturePreference();renderTemperatureChoices()};$('hideAllTemperatures').onclick=()=>{selectedTemperatures=new Set();saveTemperaturePreference();renderTemperatureChoices()};

function renderFiles(){applyFileView();const container=$('files'),query=$('search').value.toLowerCase();container.replaceChildren();const matching=files.filter(f=>f.path.toLowerCase().includes(query));if(!matching.length){container.textContent=files.length?'No matching files':'No G-code files available';return}for(const f of matching.slice(0,100)){const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='file';row.dataset.filename=f.path;const img=document.createElement('img');img.className='filethumb';img.alt='Model preview';img.loading='lazy';img.src=scoped('/api/thumbnail?filename='+encodeURIComponent(f.path));const thumbnail=document.createElement('button');thumbnail.type='button';thumbnail.className='thumbnailpreview filethumbnail';thumbnail.setAttribute('aria-label','Preview '+f.path);const overlay=document.createElement('span');overlay.className='previewoverlay';overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');iconLabel(overlay,'expand','');thumbnail.append(img,overlay);thumbnail.onclick=()=>openPreview(f.path);img.onerror=()=>{img.hidden=true;thumbnail.disabled=true;thumbnail.classList.add('missingpreview');overlay.hidden=true};const desc=document.createElement('span');desc.className='filedesc';desc.textContent=f.path;const info=document.createElement('small');info.className='fileestimates';info.textContent=fileEstimateLabel(cachedFileMetadata(f.path))+' · '+number(f.size/1024/1024,1)+' MB';desc.append(info);const start=document.createElement('button');iconLabel(start,'play','Start print');start.className='start';start.disabled=busy||!online||['printing','paused'].includes(state);start.onclick=()=>selectPrintColors(f.path);row.append(thumbnail,desc,start);container.append(row)}observeFileEstimates()}
async function loadFiles(){const id=selectedPrinter;try{const result=await request('/api/files');if(id!==selectedPrinter||homeActive)return;files=result;files=files.filter(f=>/\.(gcode|gco|g|gcode\.3mf)$/i.test(f.path)).sort((a,b)=>b.modified-a.modified);renderFiles()}catch(e){text('files','Could not load files: '+e.message)}}
function confirmAction(data,title,message){const action={printer:selectedPrinter,...data};if(data.action!=='home'){applyAction(action);return}pending=action;text('confirmTitle',title);text('confirmText',message);$('confirm').showModal()}
async function applyAction(action){if(busy)return;busy=true;buttons();try{if(action.management){await request('/api/printers',action);await loadPrinters();toast('Printer removed')}else{await request('/api/control',action);if(action.action==='heat'&&action.printer===selectedPrinter){const row=[...document.querySelectorAll('.targetform')].find(f=>f.dataset.heater===action.heater);if(row){const input=row.querySelector('input');input.dataset.dirty='';input.value=action.target}}if(action.printer===selectedPrinter){if(action.action==='tune'){const field=$('tuningRows').querySelector('[data-parameter="'+action.parameter+'"]');if(field)delete field.dataset.dirty}if(action.action==='output'){const row=[...$('outputRows').children].find(r=>r.dataset.output===action.id);const field=row?.querySelector('input');if(field)delete field.dataset.dirty}}toast('Command accepted by printer')}}catch(e){toast(e.message)}finally{busy=false;buttons()}}
$('dismiss').onclick=()=>{$('confirm').close();pending=null};$('proceed').onclick=async()=>{const action=pending;pending=null;$('confirm').close();if(action)await applyAction(action)};
document.querySelectorAll('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const action=b.dataset.action;confirmAction({action},action==='emergency_stop'?'Emergency stop?':`${b.textContent}?`,action==='emergency_stop'?'This immediately halts the printer, disables heaters, and puts Klipper into shutdown. The current print cannot continue without recovery.':action==='cancel'?'This cancels the current print job.':'Send this command to your printer?')});
$('search').oninput=renderFiles;$('refreshFiles').onclick=refreshFileTab;
async function loadCamera(){const id=selectedPrinter;const image=$('video');image.hidden=true;image.removeAttribute('src');$('liveBadge').hidden=true;$('cameraMessage').hidden=false;try{const {camera}=await request('/api/camera');if(id!==selectedPrinter||homeActive)return;if(!camera){text('cameraMessage','No camera is configured in Moonraker.');return}image.style.transform=`rotate(${camera.rotation||0}deg) scale(${camera.flip_horizontal?-1:1},${camera.flip_vertical?-1:1})`;image.onload=()=>{image.hidden=false;$('cameraMessage').hidden=true;$('liveBadge').hidden=false};image.onerror=()=>{image.hidden=true;$('liveBadge').hidden=true;$('cameraMessage').hidden=false;text('cameraMessage','Camera unavailable. Check the printer’s camera, then reconnect.')};image.src=scoped('/camera/stream?t='+Date.now(),id)}catch(e){text('cameraMessage','Camera connection unavailable: '+e.message)}}
$('refreshCamera').onclick=loadCamera;window.addEventListener('resize',draw);loadPrinters();

function thumbnailUrl(filename){return scoped('/api/thumbnail?filename='+encodeURIComponent(filename))}
function updateJobPreview(filename,plate){currentFilename=filename;currentPlate=plate||'';const key=JSON.stringify([selectedPrinter,filename,currentPlate]);if(key===jobPreviewKey&&(!jobPreviewRetryAt||Date.now()<jobPreviewRetryAt))return;jobPreviewKey=key;jobPreviewRetryAt=0;const image=$('jobPreview'),message=$('jobPreviewEmpty'),enlarge=$('jobPreviewTrigger');image.hidden=true;image.removeAttribute('src');message.hidden=false;enlarge.hidden=true;text('jobPreviewEmpty',filename?'Loading model preview…':'Preview appears when a print file is loaded');if(!filename)return;image.onload=()=>{if(key!==jobPreviewKey)return;image.hidden=false;message.hidden=true;enlarge.hidden=false};image.onerror=()=>{if(key!==jobPreviewKey)return;image.hidden=true;message.hidden=false;text('jobPreviewEmpty','Model image unavailable. Include thumbnails when slicing your file.');jobPreviewRetryAt=Date.now()+30000};image.src=thumbnailUrl(filename)+'&plate='+encodeURIComponent(currentPlate)+'&t='+Date.now()}
function openPreview(filename,plate=''){text('previewName',filename);$('previewImage').hidden=true;$('previewMessage').hidden=true;const image=$('previewImage');image.onload=()=>{image.hidden=false};image.onerror=()=>{$('previewMessage').hidden=false;image.hidden=true};image.src=thumbnailUrl(filename)+'&plate='+encodeURIComponent(plate);$('preview').showModal()}
$('jobPreviewTrigger').onclick=()=>{if(currentFilename)openPreview(currentFilename,currentPlate)};
$('closePreview').onclick=()=>$('preview').close();
function switchPrinter(id){window.scrollTo({top:0});homeActive=false;homeEpoch++;clearTimeout(homeTimer);releaseHomeCameras();$('homeView').hidden=true;$('detailView').hidden=false;window.history.replaceState(null,'','#printer='+encodeURIComponent(id));selectedPrinter=id;controlStatus={};controlModels=[];controlSignature='';hoverAt=null;$('chartTooltip').hidden=true;loadControlPreferences();localStorage.setItem('selectedPrinter',id);$('printerSelect').value=id;const p=printerList.find(p=>p.id===id);text('printerTitle',(p?.name||'Printer')+' control center');text('printerAddress',(p?.name||'Printer')+' · '+(p?.url||'Connecting…')+' · Moonraker');pollGeneration++;online=false;state='';files=[];fileMetadataGeneration++;liveFilamentLength=null;history=[];jobPreviewKey='';currentFilename='';currentPlate='';jobPreviewRetryAt=0;$('jobPreview').hidden=true;$('jobPreview').removeAttribute('src');$('jobPreviewEmpty').hidden=false;text('jobPreviewEmpty','Preview appears when a print file is loaded');$('jobPreviewTrigger').hidden=true;$('confirm').close();pending=null;buttons();text('connection','Connecting…');statusBadge($('jobstate'),'connecting');text('filename','Waiting for printer status');$('error').hidden=true;for(const key of ['progress','elapsed','remaining','layer','position','speed','filament'])text(key,'—');temperatureSignature='';temperatureModels=[];$('temperatureSelect').close();text('temperatureRows','');$('chartLegend').replaceChildren();delete $('chartLegend').dataset.signature;$('fill').style.width='0%';draw();resetFileTabs();loadFiles();loadCamera();startStatusStream(id);poll(pollGeneration)}
function renderPrinterList(){const list=$('printerList');list.replaceChildren();for(const p of printerList){const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='printerrow';const name=document.createElement('span');name.textContent=p.name;const address=document.createElement('small');address.textContent=p.url;name.append(address);const controls=document.createElement('div');controls.className='actions';controls.style.marginTop='0';const edit=document.createElement('button');edit.type='button';edit.textContent='Edit';edit.onclick=()=>{editing=p.id;text('formTitle','Edit printer');$('printerName').value=p.name;$('printerUrl').value=p.url;$('printerCamera').value=p.camera_base||'';$('printerKey').value='';$('printerKey').placeholder=p.has_api_key?'Leave blank to keep saved key':'Only if your printer requires one';$('formError').hidden=true};const remove=document.createElement('button');remove.type='button';remove.textContent='Remove';remove.disabled=printerList.length===1;remove.onclick=()=>confirmAction({action:'remove',id:p.id,management:true},'Remove '+p.name+'?','This removes the dashboard connection only. It does not delete printer files or stop a print.');controls.append(edit,remove);row.append(name,controls);list.append(row)}}
async function loadPrinters(preferred){try{const result=await request('/api/printers');printerList=result.printers;$('printerSelect').replaceChildren();for(const p of printerList){const option=document.createElement('option');option.value=p.id;option.textContent=p.name;$('printerSelect').append(option)}renderPrinterList();const id=preferred||selectedPrinter||localStorage.getItem('selectedPrinter');if(preferred&&!homeActive&&printerList.some(p=>p.id===preferred))switchPrinter(preferred);else routePage()}catch(e){text('error','Could not load printers: '+e.message);$('error').hidden=false}}
$('printerSelect').onchange=e=>switchPrinter(e.target.value);
function resetForm(){editing='';$('printerForm').reset();text('formTitle','Add printer');$('formError').hidden=true;$('printerKey').placeholder='Only if your printer requires one'}
$('managePrinters').onclick=()=>{resetForm();renderPrinterList();$('manage').showModal()};$('newPrinter').onclick=resetForm;$('closeManage').onclick=()=>$('manage').close();
$('printerForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();$('savePrinter').disabled=true;try{const result=await request('/api/printers',{action:editing?'edit':'add',id:editing,name:$('printerName').value,url:$('printerUrl').value,camera_base:$('printerCamera').value,api_key:$('printerKey').value});const id=editing||result.printers.at(-1).id;resetForm();await loadPrinters(id);toast('Printer saved');$('manage').close()}catch(error){text('formError',error.message);$('formError').hidden=false}finally{$('savePrinter').disabled=false}};

function releaseHomeCameras(){for(const card of homeCards.values()){card.image.onload=null;card.image.onerror=null;card.image.removeAttribute('src')}}
function showHome(){window.scrollTo({top:0});homeActive=true;homeEpoch++;const epoch=homeEpoch;clearTimeout(homeTimer);pollGeneration++;online=false;buttons();$('detailView').hidden=true;$('homeView').hidden=false;$('error').hidden=true;$('confirm').close();$('preview').close();$('temperatureSelect').close();pending=null;$('video').removeAttribute('src');$('video').onload=null;$('video').onerror=null;text('connection',printerList.length+' printers');$('connection').classList.remove('offline');renderHomeCards(epoch);startStatusStream('all');pollHome(epoch)}
function routePage(){const hash=location.hash;const id=hash.startsWith('#printer=')?decodeURIComponent(hash.slice(9)):'';if(id&&printerList.some(p=>p.id===id))switchPrinter(id);else showHome()}
$('backHome').onclick=()=>{location.hash='home'};window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{if(printerList.length)routePage()});
function renderHomeCards(epoch){releaseHomeCameras();homeCards.clear();const tiles=$('printerTiles');tiles.replaceChildren();text('homeSummary','Checking printers…');for(const p of printerList){const link=document.createElement('a');link.className='printertile';link.href='#printer='+encodeURIComponent(p.id);link.setAttribute('aria-label','Open '+p.name+' controls');const head=document.createElement('div');head.className='tilehead';const name=document.createElement('h2');name.textContent=p.name;const badge=document.createElement('span');badge.className='badge';badge.textContent='Connecting…';head.append(name,badge);const camera=document.createElement('div');camera.className='homecamera';const image=document.createElement('img');image.alt=p.name+' camera thumbnail';image.hidden=true;const message=document.createElement('p');message.textContent='Loading camera…';camera.append(image,message);const body=document.createElement('div');body.className='tilebody';const filename=document.createElement('p');filename.className='tilefilename';filename.textContent='Waiting for printer status';const progress=document.createElement('div');progress.className='tileprogress';const label=document.createElement('span');label.textContent='Print progress';const percent=document.createElement('strong');percent.textContent='—';progress.append(label,percent);const track=document.createElement('div');track.className='track';const fill=document.createElement('div');fill.className='fill';track.append(fill);const foot=document.createElement('div');foot.className='tilefoot';const timing=document.createElement('span');timing.textContent='';const open=document.createElement('span');open.textContent='Layers — / —';foot.append(timing,open);body.append(filename,progress,track,foot);link.append(head,camera,body);tiles.append(link);homeCards.set(p.id,{image,message,badge,filename,percent,fill,timing,layers:open,reachable:false,state:'',lastImage:0,streaming:false});refreshHomeCamera(p.id,epoch)}}
async function refreshHomeCamera(id,epoch){const card=homeCards.get(id);if(!card||epoch!==homeEpoch||!homeActive||card.streaming||card.cameraLoading)return;card.lastImage=Date.now();card.cameraLoading=true;try{if(card.cameraInfo===undefined||Date.now()-card.cameraCheckedAt>60000){const response=await fetch(scoped('/api/camera',id),{signal:AbortSignal.timeout(10000)});const data=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw Error('Camera unavailable');if(epoch!==homeEpoch||!homeActive)return;card.cameraInfo=data.camera;card.cameraCheckedAt=Date.now()}if(!card.cameraInfo){card.image.hidden=true;card.message.hidden=false;card.message.textContent='No camera configured';return}const camera=card.cameraInfo;card.image.style.transform='rotate('+(camera.rotation||0)+'deg) scale('+(camera.flip_horizontal?-1:1)+','+(camera.flip_vertical?-1:1)+')';card.image.onload=()=>{if(epoch!==homeEpoch||!homeActive)return;card.image.hidden=false;card.message.hidden=true};card.image.onerror=()=>{if(epoch!==homeEpoch||!homeActive)return;if(!card.streaming){card.streaming=true;card.image.src=scoped('/camera/stream',id);return}card.streaming=false;card.lastImage=Date.now();card.image.hidden=true;card.message.hidden=false;card.message.textContent='Camera unavailable'};card.image.src=scoped('/camera/snapshot?t='+Date.now(),id)}catch(error){if(epoch!==homeEpoch||!homeActive)return;card.image.hidden=true;card.message.hidden=false;card.message.textContent='Camera unavailable'}finally{card.cameraLoading=false}}

async function pollHome(epoch,updates=null){if(epoch!==homeEpoch||!homeActive)return;await Promise.allSettled(printerList.filter(p=>!updates||updates[p.id]).map(async p=>{const card=homeCards.get(p.id);try{let data=updates?.[p.id];if(!data){const response=await fetch(scoped('/api/status',p.id),{signal:AbortSignal.timeout(12000)});data=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw Error(data.error||'Printer unavailable')}if(data.error)throw Error(data.error);if(epoch!==homeEpoch||!homeActive)return;const s=data.status,job=s.print_stats||{},active=['printing','paused'].includes(job.state),fraction=s.virtual_sdcard?.progress??s.display_status?.progress??0;const percent=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,fraction))*100);card.reachable=true;card.state=job.state;const currentLayer=job.info?.current_layer,totalLayers=job.info?.total_layer;card.layers.textContent='Layers '+(Number.isFinite(currentLayer)?currentLayer:active?0:'—')+' / '+(Number.isFinite(totalLayers)?totalLayers:'—');statusBadge(card.badge,job.state||'standby');card.filename.textContent=job.filename||'No active print';card.percent.textContent=active||job.filename?percent+'%':'—';card.fill.style.width=(active||job.filename?percent:0)+'%';card.timing.textContent=active?'Elapsed '+time(job.print_duration):job.state==='complete'?'Print finished':'Ready for your next print';if(!card.streaming&&Date.now()-card.lastImage>=10000)refreshHomeCamera(p.id,epoch)}catch(error){if(epoch!==homeEpoch||!homeActive)return;card.reachable=false;card.state='offline';statusBadge(card.badge,'offline');card.filename.textContent='Cannot reach this printer';card.percent.textContent='—';card.fill.style.width='0%';card.timing.textContent='Check connection';card.layers.textContent='Layers — / —'}if(epoch===homeEpoch&&homeActive){const cards=[...homeCards.values()];text('homeSummary',cards.filter(c=>c.reachable).length+' / '+printerList.length+' online · '+cards.filter(c=>c.state==='printing').length+' printing')}}));if(epoch===homeEpoch&&homeActive&&!streamConnected&&!updates)homeTimer=setTimeout(()=>pollHome(epoch),5000)}
function loadControlPreferences(){let prefs={};try{prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('controls:'+selectedPrinter)||'{}')}catch{}hiddenControlItems=new Set(Array.isArray(prefs.hiddenItems)?prefs.hiddenItems:[]);$('controlBody').hidden=!!prefs.collapsed;for(const check of $('controlChoices').querySelectorAll('input'))check.checked=!prefs.hidden?.includes(check.value);applyControlPreferences()}
function applyControlPreferences(){for(const section of document.querySelectorAll('[data-control-group]'))section.hidden=![...$('controlChoices').querySelectorAll('input')].find(c=>c.value===section.dataset.controlGroup).checked;document.querySelectorAll('[data-control-item]').forEach(row=>row.hidden=hiddenControlItems.has(row.dataset.controlItem));text('toggleControls',$('controlBody').hidden?'Show controls':'Hide controls');$('toggleControls').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!$('controlBody').hidden))}
function saveControlPreferences(){try{localStorage.setItem('controls:'+selectedPrinter,JSON.stringify({collapsed:$('controlBody').hidden,hiddenItems:[...hiddenControlItems],hidden:[...$('controlChoices').querySelectorAll('input')].filter(c=>!c.checked).map(c=>c.value)}))}catch{}applyControlPreferences()}
$('toggleControls').onclick=()=>{$('controlBody').hidden=!$('controlBody').hidden;saveControlPreferences()};$('customizeControls').onclick=()=>{renderControlItemChoices();$('controlSelect').showModal()};$('closeControlSelect').onclick=()=>$('controlSelect').close();$('controlChoices').onchange=saveControlPreferences;
function controlButtons(){boxButtons();const blocked=busy||!online,active=['printing','paused'].includes(state),homed=controlStatus.toolhead?.homed_axes||'';document.querySelectorAll('[data-jog],[data-home],[data-extrude],[data-offset]').forEach(b=>{const axis=b.dataset.jog?.split(':')[0].toLowerCase();b.disabled=blocked||((b.dataset.home||b.dataset.jog||b.dataset.extrude)&&active)||axis&&!homed.includes(axis)||b.dataset.offset&&!homed.includes('z');if(b.dataset.extrude){const e=controlStatus[controlStatus.toolhead?.extruder||'extruder'];b.disabled=b.disabled||!e||e.can_extrude===false}});document.querySelectorAll('#tuningRows input,#tuningRows button,#outputRows input,#outputRows button').forEach(e=>e.disabled=blocked)}
function renderControls(s,rows){controlStatus=s;controlModels=rows;const tool=s.toolhead||{},move=s.gcode_move||{},extruder=tool.extruder||'extruder',e=s[extruder]||{};text('axisReadings',(tool.position||[]).slice(0,3).map((v,i)=>'XYZ'[i]+' '+number(v,2)+' mm').join(' · ')||'Position unavailable');text('motionHint',['printing','paused'].includes(state)?'Manual movement is unavailable during an active print.':'Homed axes: '+(tool.homed_axes?.toUpperCase()||'none')+'. Home an axis before moving it.');text('offsetReading',number(move.homing_origin?.[2],3)+' mm');text('extruderHint',extruder+' · '+number(e.temperature)+'°C'+(e.can_extrude===false?' · Heat before extruding':''));const tuning=[['speed','Speed','%',10,200,1,(move.speed_factor||1)*100],['flow','Flow','%',10,200,1,(move.extrude_factor||1)*100]];if(Number.isFinite(e.pressure_advance))tuning.push(['pressure_advance','Pressure advance','s',0,1,.001,e.pressure_advance]);if(Number.isFinite(e.smooth_time))tuning.push(['smooth_time','Smooth time','s',.001,.2,.001,e.smooth_time]);const sig=JSON.stringify([selectedPrinter,tuning.map(t=>t[0]),rows.map(r=>[r.id,r.editable,r.binary])]);if(sig!==controlSignature){controlSignature=sig;$('tuningRows').replaceChildren();$('outputRows').replaceChildren();for(const t of tuning){const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='controlrow';row.dataset.controlItem='tune:'+t[0];row.dataset.itemLabel=t[1];const label=document.createElement('span');label.textContent=t[1];const form=document.createElement('form'),input=document.createElement('input'),unit=document.createElement('small'),button=document.createElement('button');input.type='number';input.required=true;input.min=t[3];input.max=t[4];input.step=t[5];input.dataset.parameter=t[0];input.setAttribute('aria-label',t[1]);input.oninput=()=>input.dataset.dirty='true';unit.textContent=t[2];button.textContent='✓';button.setAttribute('aria-label','Apply '+t[1]);form.append(input,unit,button);form.onsubmit=event=>{event.preventDefault();if(input.checkValidity())confirmAction({action:'tune',parameter:t[0],value:Number(input.value)},'Set '+t[1]+'?',input.value+' '+t[2]+' on this printer')};row.append(label,form);$('tuningRows').append(row)}for(const r of rows){const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='controlrow';row.dataset.output=r.id;row.dataset.controlItem='output:'+r.id;row.dataset.itemLabel=r.name;const label=document.createElement('span');label.textContent=r.name;row.append(label);if(r.editable){if(r.binary){const button=document.createElement('button');button.type='button';button.className='outputswitch';button.setAttribute('role','switch');button.setAttribute('aria-label',r.name);const thumb=document.createElement('span');thumb.className='switchthumb';thumb.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');button.append(thumb);button.onclick=()=>{const current=controlModels.find(x=>x.id===r.id);confirmAction({action:'output',id:r.id,value:current.value>0?0:1},'Switch '+r.name+'?',current.value>0?'Turn off '+r.name+'?':'Turn on '+r.name+'?')};row.append(button)}else{const form=document.createElement('form'),input=document.createElement('input'),unit=document.createElement('small'),button=document.createElement('button');input.type='number';input.min=0;input.max=100;input.step=1;input.required=true;input.setAttribute('aria-label',r.name+' percent');input.oninput=()=>input.dataset.dirty='true';unit.textContent='%';button.textContent='✓';button.setAttribute('aria-label','Apply '+r.name);form.append(input,unit,button);form.onsubmit=event=>{event.preventDefault();if(input.checkValidity())confirmAction({action:'output',id:r.id,value:Number(input.value)/100},'Set '+r.name+'?',input.value+'% on this printer')};row.append(form)}}else{const value=document.createElement('small');value.className='automatic';row.append(value)}$('outputRows').append(row)}}for(const t of tuning){const input=$('tuningRows').querySelector('[data-parameter="'+t[0]+'"]');if(!input.dataset.dirty&&document.activeElement!==input)input.value=Number(t[6].toFixed(3))}for(const r of rows){const row=[...$('outputRows').children].find(el=>el.dataset.output===r.id),input=row.querySelector('input'),button=row.querySelector('button');if(input&&!input.dataset.dirty&&document.activeElement!==input)input.value=Math.round(r.value/(r.output?r.scale:1)*100);if(r.binary&&button){const on=r.value>0;button.setAttribute('aria-checked',String(on));button.title=r.name+' · '+(on?'On':'Off');}if(!r.editable)row.querySelector('.automatic').textContent=(r.value>0?Math.round(r.value*100)+'%':'Off')+' · Automatic'}applyControlPreferences();if($('controlSelect').open)renderControlItemChoices();controlButtons()}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-home]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>confirmAction({action:'home',axis:b.dataset.home},'Home '+b.dataset.home+'?', 'The toolhead will move to its homing position.'));
document.querySelectorAll('[data-jog]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const [axis,direction]=b.dataset.jog.split(':'),amount=Number(direction)*Number($('moveDistance').value);confirmAction({action:'jog',axis,amount},'Move '+axis+'?',amount+' mm on this printer')});
document.querySelectorAll('[data-extrude]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const length=$('extrudeLength'),speed=$('extrudeSpeed');if(!length.reportValidity()||!speed.reportValidity())return;confirmAction({action:'extrude',length:Number(length.value)*Number(b.dataset.extrude),speed:Number(speed.value)},b.textContent+'?',length.value+' mm at '+speed.value+' mm/s through the active extruder')});
document.querySelectorAll('[data-offset]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const amount=Number(b.dataset.offset)*Number($('offsetStep').value);confirmAction({action:'zoffset',amount},'Adjust Z offset?',amount+' mm. This changes the current session offset; it does not save calibration.')});
function renderChartTooltip(point,chosen){const tip=$('chartTooltip');tip.replaceChildren();const stamp=document.createElement('small');stamp.textContent=new Date(point.at).toLocaleTimeString()+' · Actual / Target / Power';tip.append(stamp);for(const r of chosen){const value=point.readings?.[r.id]||{},row=document.createElement('div'),name=document.createElement('span'),dot=document.createElement('i'),reading=document.createElement('strong');row.className='tooltiprow';dot.style.background=temperatureColor(r.id);name.append(dot,document.createTextNode(r.name+':'));reading.textContent=number(value.actual,2)+'°C / '+(Number.isFinite(value.target)?number(value.target,0)+'°C':'—')+' / '+(Number.isFinite(value.power)?Math.round(value.power*100)+'%':'—');row.append(name,reading);tip.append(row)}tip.hidden=!chosen.length}
function chartPointer(event){const rect=$('chart').getBoundingClientRect(),x=Math.max(38,Math.min(rect.width-8,event.clientX-rect.left));hoverAt=Date.now()-300000*(1-(x-38)/Math.max(1,rect.width-46));draw()}
$('chart').onpointermove=chartPointer;$('chart').onpointerdown=chartPointer;$('chart').onpointerleave=()=>{hoverAt=null;$('chartTooltip').hidden=true;draw()};$('chart').onkeydown=event=>{if(['ArrowLeft','ArrowRight'].includes(event.key)&&history.length){event.preventDefault();const index=hoverAt===null?history.length-1:history.reduce((best,p,i)=>Math.abs(p.at-hoverAt)<Math.abs(history[best].at-hoverAt)?i:best,0);hoverAt=history[Math.max(0,Math.min(history.length-1,index+(event.key==='ArrowLeft'?-1:1)))].at;draw()}if(event.key==='Escape'){hoverAt=null;$('chartTooltip').hidden=true;draw()}};$('chart').onblur=()=>{hoverAt=null;$('chartTooltip').hidden=true;draw()};

function renderControlItemChoices(){const container=$('controlItemChoices');const items=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-control-item]')];const signature=JSON.stringify([selectedPrinter,items.map(r=>[r.dataset.controlItem,r.dataset.itemLabel])]);if(container.dataset.signature===signature)return;container.dataset.signature=signature;container.replaceChildren();for(const [id,title] of [['tuningRows','Print tuning items'],['outputRows','Fan & output items']]){const heading=document.createElement('h3');heading.textContent=title;container.append(heading);const rows=[...$(id).querySelectorAll('[data-control-item]')];if(!rows.length){const hint=document.createElement('p');hint.className='notice';hint.textContent='Items appear when this printer connects.';container.append(hint)}for(const row of rows){const label=document.createElement('label');label.className='temperaturechoice';const check=document.createElement('input');check.type='checkbox';check.checked=!hiddenControlItems.has(row.dataset.controlItem);check.onchange=()=>{if(check.checked)hiddenControlItems.delete(row.dataset.controlItem);else hiddenControlItems.add(row.dataset.controlItem);saveControlPreferences()};label.append(check,document.createTextNode(row.dataset.itemLabel));container.append(label)}}}

$('showAllControlItems').onclick=()=>{hiddenControlItems.clear();saveControlPreferences();$('controlItemChoices').dataset.signature='';renderControlItemChoices()};

function metadataKey(filename,id=selectedPrinter){const f=files.find(f=>f.path===filename);return JSON.stringify([id,filename,f?.modified||0])}
function cachedFileMetadata(filename){return fileMetadataCache.get(metadataKey(filename))?.value}
async function readFileMetadata(filename,id=selectedPrinter){const key=metadataKey(filename,id);const cached=fileMetadataCache.get(key);if(cached)return cached.promise;const record={value:null};record.promise=request('/api/metadata?filename='+encodeURIComponent(filename)).then(value=>{record.value=value;return value}).catch(()=>null);fileMetadataCache.set(key,record);if(fileMetadataCache.size>500)fileMetadataCache.delete(fileMetadataCache.keys().next().value);return record.promise}
function fileEstimateLabel(meta){return (Number.isFinite(meta?.filament_weight_total)?number(meta.filament_weight_total,1)+' g':'Weight —')+' · '+(Number.isFinite(meta?.estimated_time)?time(meta.estimated_time):'Duration —')}

function updateFilamentGrams(filename){const length=liveFilamentLength;if(!Number.isFinite(length)){text('filament','—');return}if(length===0){text('filament','0.0 g');$('filament').title='No filament used';return}const id=selectedPrinter,meta=cachedFileMetadata(filename);function display(value){if(id!==selectedPrinter||filename!==currentFilename)return;const weight=value?.filament_weight_total,total=value?.filament_total;const grams=Number.isFinite(weight)&&weight>0&&Number.isFinite(total)&&total>0?liveFilamentLength*weight/total:null;text('filament',Number.isFinite(grams)?'≈ '+number(grams,1)+' g':'— g');$('filament').title=Number.isFinite(grams)?'Estimated from filament length used × slicer total weight / slicer total length.':'Weight estimate unavailable: this file needs filament weight and length metadata.'}if(meta)display(meta);else{display(null);if(filename)readFileMetadata(filename,id).then(display)}}

function startStatusStream(id){if(statusStream)statusStream.close();streamConnected=false;const source=new EventSource('/api/events?printer='+encodeURIComponent(id));statusStream=source;source.onopen=()=>{if(statusStream===source)streamConnected=true};source.onmessage=event=>{if(statusStream!==source)return;try{const update=JSON.parse(event.data);if(homeActive&&id==='all')pollHome(homeEpoch,{[update.printer]:update.data});else if(!homeActive&&update.printer===selectedPrinter)poll(pollGeneration,update.data)}catch{}};source.onerror=()=>{if(statusStream!==source)return;const previously=streamConnected;streamConnected=false;if(previously){if(homeActive)pollHome(homeEpoch);else poll(pollGeneration)}}}
function observeFileEstimates(){if(fileObserver)fileObserver.disconnect();const id=selectedPrinter;fileObserver=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{for(const entry of entries){if(!entry.isIntersecting)continue;fileObserver.unobserve(entry.target);const filename=entry.target.dataset.filename,f=files.find(f=>f.path===filename);if(!f)continue;readFileMetadata(filename,id).then(meta=>{if(id!==selectedPrinter||!entry.target.isConnected)return;entry.target.querySelector('.fileestimates').textContent=fileEstimateLabel(meta)+' · '+number(f.size/1024/1024,1)+' MB'})}},{root:$('files'),rootMargin:'120px'});for(const row of $('files').children)fileObserver.observe(row)}
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden){if(statusStream)statusStream.close();statusStream=null;streamConnected=true;const image=$('video');if(image)image.removeAttribute('src');releaseHomeCameras()}else{startStatusStream(homeActive?'all':selectedPrinter);if(homeActive){renderHomeCards(homeEpoch);pollHome(homeEpoch)}else{loadCamera();poll(pollGeneration)}}});

let fileUploading=false;
function applyFileView(view){if(!view){try{view=localStorage.getItem('fileView:'+selectedPrinter)||'detail'}catch{view='detail'}}view=view==='grid'?'grid':'detail';$('files').dataset.view=view;$('fileGrid').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(view==='grid'));$('fileDetail').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(view==='detail'))}
function chooseFileView(view){try{localStorage.setItem('fileView:'+selectedPrinter,view)}catch{}applyFileView(view);observeFileEstimates()}
$('fileGrid').onclick=()=>chooseFileView('grid');$('fileDetail').onclick=()=>chooseFileView('detail');$('uploadFiles').onclick=()=>{if(!fileUploading)$('fileUploadInput').click()};
function uploadClientFile(file,printer,index,total){return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const xhr=new XMLHttpRequest();xhr.open('POST','/api/upload?printer='+encodeURIComponent(printer)+'&filename='+encodeURIComponent(file.name));xhr.setRequestHeader('X-Control-Token',token);xhr.setRequestHeader('Content-Type','application/octet-stream');xhr.timeout=240000;$('uploadStatus').hidden=false;text('uploadLabel','Uploading '+index+'/'+total+': '+file.name);$('uploadProgress').value=0;xhr.upload.onprogress=e=>{if(e.lengthComputable)$('uploadProgress').value=Math.round(e.loaded/e.total*100)};xhr.upload.onload=()=>text('uploadLabel','Saving '+file.name+' to printer…');xhr.onload=()=>{let data;try{data=JSON.parse(xhr.responseText)}catch{return reject(Error('Upload response unavailable'))}if(xhr.status>=400)return reject(Error(data.error||'Upload failed'));resolve(data)};xhr.onerror=()=>reject(Error('Upload connection failed'));xhr.ontimeout=()=>reject(Error('Upload timed out'));xhr.send(file)})}
$('fileUploadInput').onchange=async()=>{const queue=[...$('fileUploadInput').files],printer=selectedPrinter,name=printerList.find(p=>p.id===printer)?.name||'printer';if(!queue.length||fileUploading)return;fileUploading=true;$('uploadFiles').disabled=true;let completed=0;try{for(const file of queue){if(!/\.(gcode|gco|g|gcode\.3mf)$/i.test(file.name))throw Error('Choose sliced G-code or .gcode.3mf files');if(file.size===0||file.size>200*1024*1024)throw Error('Each file must be between 1 byte and 200 MB');const result=await uploadClientFile(file,printer,completed+1,queue.length);completed++;text('uploadLabel','Uploaded '+result.filename+' to '+name)}if(printer===selectedPrinter&&!homeActive)await loadFiles();toast(completed+' file'+(completed===1?'':'s')+' uploaded to '+name)}catch(error){toast(error.message);text('uploadLabel',completed+' uploaded · '+error.message);if(completed&&printer===selectedPrinter&&!homeActive)loadFiles()}finally{fileUploading=false;$('uploadFiles').disabled=false;$('fileUploadInput').value='';$('uploadProgress').value=completed===queue.length?100:0}};

let boxCatalogs=new Map(),boxSignature='',boxStatus=null;
const boxSettingLabels={enable_box:'Use multimaterial box',auto_read_rfid:'Read RFID on insertion',auto_init_detect:'Detect filament on startup',auto_reload_detect:'Automatic spool switching'};
function boxButtons(){if(!$('boxPanel'))return;const blocked=busy||!online||['printing','paused'].includes(state)||!!boxStatus?.box_extras?.box_button_state||!!boxStatus?.multi_color_controller?.operation?.operate_state;document.querySelectorAll('#boxPanel input,#boxPanel select,#boxPanel button:not(#toggleBox)').forEach(e=>e.disabled=blocked);document.querySelectorAll('[data-box-command]').forEach(b=>{const slot=Number(b.dataset.slot),mode=b.dataset.boxCommand,has=boxStatus?.['box_stepper slot'+slot]?.runout_button===0,loaded=boxStatus?.multi_color_controller?.slots?.last_loaded==='slot'+slot&&boxStatus?.box_extras?.b_endstop_state===0;b.disabled=blocked||mode!=='rfid'&&(!has||(mode==='load'?loaded:!loaded))})}
$('toggleBox').onclick=()=>{const hidden=!$('boxBody').hidden;$('boxBody').hidden=hidden;$('toggleBox').textContent=hidden?'Show box':'Hide box';$('toggleBox').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!hidden));localStorage.setItem('boxCollapsed:'+selectedPrinter,String(hidden))};
function renderBox(s){boxStatus=s;const box=s.multi_color_controller;$('boxPanel').hidden=!box?.hardware?.connected;if($('boxPanel').hidden)return;const id=selectedPrinter;let catalog=boxCatalogs.get(id);if(!catalog){boxCatalogs.set(id,{loading:true});request('/api/box/catalog').then(v=>{boxCatalogs.set(id,v);if(id===selectedPrinter)renderBox(controlStatus)}).catch(e=>{boxCatalogs.delete(id);text('boxSummary','Could not load filament profiles: '+e.message)});return}if(catalog.loading)return;const count=Math.min(4,box.hardware.box_count||0),config=box.config||{},signature=JSON.stringify([id,count,catalog]);if(signature!==boxSignature){boxSignature=signature;$('boxBody').hidden=localStorage.getItem('boxCollapsed:'+id)==='true';$('toggleBox').textContent=$('boxBody').hidden?'Show box':'Hide box';$('toggleBox').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!$('boxBody').hidden));$('boxSettings').replaceChildren();$('boxSlots').replaceChildren();for(const [key,label] of Object.entries(boxSettingLabels)){const l=document.createElement('label'),check=document.createElement('input');check.type='checkbox';check.dataset.boxSetting=key;check.onchange=()=>applyAction({action:'box',mode:'setting',parameter:key,value:check.checked?1:0});l.append(check,document.createTextNode(label));$('boxSettings').append(l)}for(const slot of [...Array(count*4).keys(),16]){const card=document.createElement('section');card.className='boxslot';card.dataset.boxSlot=slot;const heading=document.createElement('h3'),swatch=document.createElement('span'),name=document.createElement('span'),status=document.createElement('small');swatch.className='boxswatch';name.textContent=slot===16?'External spool':`Box ${Math.floor(slot/4)+1} · ${'ABCD'[slot%4]}`;heading.append(swatch,name);status.className='muted';card.append(heading,status);const fields={};for(const [field,group] of [['vendor','vendors'],['filament','filaments'],['color','colors']]){const label=document.createElement('label'),select=document.createElement('select');label.textContent=field[0].toUpperCase()+field.slice(1);select.setAttribute('aria-label',name.textContent+' '+field);select.dataset.boxField=field;for(const [key,v] of Object.entries(catalog[group])){const option=document.createElement('option');option.value=key;option.textContent=field==='filament'?v.filament:field==='color'?key+' · '+v:v;select.append(option)}select.onchange=()=>card.dataset.dirty='true';label.append(select);if(field==='color'){select.hidden=true;const palette=document.createElement('div');palette.className='boxpalette';palette.hidden=true;const selectedColor=document.createElement('button');selectedColor.type='button';selectedColor.className='boxselectedcolor';selectedColor.setAttribute('aria-label',name.textContent+' selected color');selectedColor.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');selectedColor.onclick=()=>{palette.hidden=!palette.hidden;selectedColor.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!palette.hidden))};label.append(selectedColor);palette.setAttribute('role','group');palette.setAttribute('aria-label',name.textContent+' color swatches');for(const [key,color] of Object.entries(catalog.colors)){const button=document.createElement('button');button.type='button';button.className='boxcolor';button.dataset.color=key;button.style.background=color;button.title=color;button.setAttribute('aria-label','Select color '+color);button.onclick=()=>{select.value=key;card.dataset.dirty='true';palette.hidden=true;selectedColor.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');updateBoxSwatches(card,catalog)};palette.append(button)}label.append(palette)}card.append(label);fields[field]=select}const actions=document.createElement('div');actions.className='actions';const save=document.createElement('button');save.textContent='Save material';save.onclick=async()=>{await applyAction({action:'box',mode:'material',slot,...Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(fields).map(([k,v])=>[k,v.value]))});delete card.dataset.dirty};actions.append(save);if(slot!==16)for(const [mode,label] of [['rfid','Read RFID'],['load','Load'],['unload','Unload'],['eject','Eject']]){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=label;b.dataset.boxCommand=mode;b.dataset.slot=slot;b.onclick=()=>applyAction({action:'box',mode,slot});actions.append(b)}card.append(actions);$('boxSlots').append(card)}}const humidity=[...Array(count)].map((_,i)=>{const h=s['aht20_f heater_box'+(i+1)];return 'Box '+(i+1)+(h?': '+number(h.humidity)+'% humidity':'')});text('boxSummary',humidity.join(' · ')+' · '+(box.extruder?.loaded?'Filament loaded':'Extruder empty'));const op=box.operation||{};text('boxOperation',op.error||((s.box_extras?.box_button_state||op.operate_state)?'Box operation in progress · '+(op.progress||0)+'%':'Load and unload can heat the nozzle and move filament.'));for(const check of $('boxSettings').querySelectorAll('input'))check.checked=config[check.dataset.boxSetting]===1;for(const card of $('boxSlots').children){const slot=Number(card.dataset.boxSlot),material=box.slots?.materials?.['slot'+slot]||{},loaded=box.slots?.last_loaded==='slot'+slot&&box.extruder?.loaded;card.classList.toggle('loaded',loaded);card.querySelector('.boxswatch').style.background=material.color||'#888';card.querySelector('small').textContent=loaded?'Loaded':slot===16?'External spool':s['box_stepper slot'+slot]?.runout_button===0?'Filament present':'Empty';if(!card.dataset.dirty)for(const select of card.querySelectorAll('select'))select.value=String(config[select.dataset.boxField+'_slot'+slot]??'');updateBoxSwatches(card,catalog)}boxButtons()}

function updateBoxSwatches(card,catalog){const selected=card.querySelector('[data-box-field="color"]').value;for(const button of card.querySelectorAll('.boxcolor'))button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(button.dataset.color===selected));const color=catalog.colors[selected];if(color){card.querySelector('.boxswatch').style.background=color;const button=card.querySelector('.boxselectedcolor');button.style.background=color;button.title=color+' · Click to change color'}}

let printSelection=null,printSelectionEpoch=0;
function colorDistance(a,b){const rgb=c=>/^#[0-9a-f]{6}$/i.test(c)?[1,3,5].map(i=>parseInt(c.slice(i,i+2),16)):[0,0,0];const x=rgb(a),y=rgb(b);return x.reduce((sum,v,i)=>sum+(v-y[i])**2,0)}
async function selectPrintColors(filename){if(busy||!online||['printing','paused'].includes(state))return;if(!controlStatus.multi_color_controller?.hardware?.connected){confirmAction({action:'start',filename},'Start this print?','');return}const epoch=++printSelectionEpoch,id=selectedPrinter;printSelection=null;text('printMappingName',filename);text('printMappingError','Loading file colors…');$('printMappingRows').replaceChildren();$('submitPrintMapping').disabled=true;$('printUseBox').checked=true;$('printUseBox').disabled=true;$('printMapping').showModal();try{const [plan,live]=await Promise.all([request('/api/print-plan?filename='+encodeURIComponent(filename)),request('/api/status')]);if(epoch!==printSelectionEpoch||id!==selectedPrinter||!$('printMapping').open)return;const s=live.status,box=s.multi_color_controller;if(!box?.hardware?.connected)throw Error('Multimaterial box is disconnected');printSelection={printer:id,filename,plan,mapping:{},status:s};const used=new Set();for(const f of plan.filaments){const row=document.createElement('section');row.className='printcolorrow';const label=document.createElement('div');label.className='printcolorlabel';const swatch=document.createElement('span');swatch.className='boxswatch';swatch.style.background=f.color;const name=document.createElement('span');name.textContent=`Print color ${f.tool+1} · ${f.type} · ${number(f.grams)} g`;label.append(swatch,name);row.append(label);const options=document.createElement('div');options.className='printslotchoices';const slots=Object.entries(box.slots.materials).filter(([key,m])=>{const n=Number(key.replace('slot',''));return n<Math.min(4,box.hardware.box_count)*4&&s['box_stepper '+key]?.runout_button===0&&m.filament.type.toUpperCase()===f.type.toUpperCase()});const ranked=[...slots].sort((a,b)=>colorDistance(f.color,a[1].color)-colorDistance(f.color,b[1].color));const best=ranked.find(([key])=>!used.has(key));if(best){printSelection.mapping[String(f.tool)]=Number(best[0].replace('slot',''));used.add(best[0])}for(const [key,m] of slots){const n=Number(key.replace('slot','')),b=document.createElement('button'),color=document.createElement('span'),textLabel=document.createElement('span');b.type='button';b.className='printslotchoice';b.dataset.tool=f.tool;b.dataset.slot=n;const slotName=`Box ${Math.floor(n/4)+1} · ${'ABCD'[n%4]}`;b.setAttribute('aria-label',`Print color ${f.tool+1}: ${slotName} ${m.filament.type}`);color.className='boxswatch';color.style.background=m.color;textLabel.textContent=slotName+' · '+m.filament.type;b.append(color,textLabel);b.onclick=()=>{printSelection.mapping[String(f.tool)]=n;updatePrintMapping()};options.append(b)}if(!slots.length){const hint=document.createElement('p');hint.className='notice';hint.textContent='No loaded box slot matches '+f.type+'. Set up the box material first.';options.append(hint)}row.append(options);$('printMappingRows').append(row)}$('printUseBox').disabled=plan.filaments.length!==1;updatePrintMapping()}catch(e){text('printMappingError',e.message)}}
function updatePrintMapping(){if(!printSelection)return;const use=$('printUseBox').checked,{plan,mapping,status}=printSelection;const selected=plan.filaments.map(f=>mapping[String(f.tool)]);const complete=selected.every(Number.isInteger)&&new Set(selected).size===selected.length;const extras=status.box_extras||{};const external=plan.filaments.length===1&&extras.e_endstop_state===1&&extras.b_endstop_state!==0;for(const b of $('printMappingRows').querySelectorAll('button')){b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(mapping[b.dataset.tool]===Number(b.dataset.slot)));b.disabled=!use}text('printMappingError',use?(complete?'Select the box slots to use for this print.':'Choose a different matching slot for each color.'):external?'Using the loaded external spool.':'Load the external spool before starting.');$('submitPrintMapping').disabled=busy||!online||selectedPrinter!==printSelection.printer||['printing','paused'].includes(state)||(use?!complete:!external)}
$('printUseBox').onchange=updatePrintMapping;
$('closePrintMapping').onclick=()=>{++printSelectionEpoch;printSelection=null;$('printMapping').close()};
$('printMapping').addEventListener('cancel',()=>{++printSelectionEpoch;printSelection=null});
$('submitPrintMapping').onclick=async()=>{if(!printSelection||$('submitPrintMapping').disabled)return;const p=printSelection;const action={action:'start',printer:p.printer,filename:p.filename,use_box:$('printUseBox').checked,mapping:p.mapping};$('printMapping').close();printSelection=null;++printSelectionEpoch;await applyAction(action)};

let printerInfoEpoch=0,printerInfoId='';
function statsDuration(seconds){if(!Number.isFinite(seconds)||seconds<0)return '—';const s=Math.floor(seconds);return `${Math.floor(s/3600)}h ${Math.floor(s%3600/60)}m ${s%60}s`}
function statsMeters(mm){return Number.isFinite(mm)&&mm>=0?(mm/1000).toLocaleString(undefined,{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2})+' m':'—'}
async function loadPrinterInformation(){const epoch=++printerInfoEpoch,id=printerInfoId;$('refreshPrinterInfo').disabled=true;text('printerInfoMessage','Loading printer history…');try{const response=await fetch(scoped('/api/printer-info',id),{signal:AbortSignal.timeout(15000)});const d=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw Error(d.error||'Could not load printer statistics');if(epoch!==printerInfoEpoch||!$('printerInfo').open)return;text('printerInfoTitle',d.printer.name+' · Printer information');text('printerInfoAddress',d.printer.url);const t=d.totals,jobs=t.total_jobs;const average=value=>Number.isFinite(jobs)&&jobs>0&&Number.isFinite(value)?value/jobs:NaN;const rows=[['Total print jobs',Number.isFinite(jobs)?Math.round(jobs).toLocaleString():'—','Longest job',statsDuration(t.longest_job)],['Total time',statsDuration(t.total_time),'Avg per print',statsDuration(average(t.total_time))],['Total print time',statsDuration(t.total_print_time),'Avg per print',statsDuration(average(t.total_print_time))],['Total filament used',statsMeters(t.total_filament_used),'Avg per print',statsMeters(average(t.total_filament_used))]];$('printerInfoStats').replaceChildren();for(const values of rows){const card=document.createElement('section');card.className='printerstat';for(let i=0;i<values.length;i++){const node=document.createElement(i%2?'strong':'small');node.textContent=values[i];card.append(node)}$('printerInfoStats').append(card)}text('printerInfoMessage','From this printer’s Moonraker print history.')}catch(e){if(epoch===printerInfoEpoch&&$('printerInfo').open)text('printerInfoMessage','Could not load printer statistics: '+e.message)}finally{if(epoch===printerInfoEpoch)$('refreshPrinterInfo').disabled=false}}
$('printerInformation').onclick=()=>{printerInfoId=selectedPrinter;const p=printerList.find(p=>p.id===printerInfoId);text('printerInfoTitle',(p?.name||'Printer')+' · Printer information');text('printerInfoAddress',p?.url||'');$('printerInfoStats').replaceChildren();$('printerInfo').showModal();loadPrinterInformation()};
function closePrinterInformation(){++printerInfoEpoch;$('printerInfo').close()}
$('closePrinterInfo').onclick=closePrinterInformation;$('donePrinterInfo').onclick=closePrinterInformation;$('printerInfo').addEventListener('cancel',()=>{++printerInfoEpoch});$('refreshPrinterInfo').onclick=loadPrinterInformation;

let fileTab='files',historyJobs=[],historyOffset=0,historyMore=false,historyRequestEpoch=0,historyLoading=false,consoleRequestEpoch=0;
function resetFileTabs(){++historyRequestEpoch;++consoleRequestEpoch;historyJobs=[];historyOffset=0;historyMore=false;historyLoading=false;text('historyMessage','');$('historyJobs').replaceChildren();$('consoleEntries').replaceChildren();$('historySearch').value='';setFileTab('files')}
function setFileTab(tab){fileTab=tab;for(const [name,pane] of [['files','fileContent'],['history','historyContent'],['console','consoleContent']]){$(name+'Tab').setAttribute('aria-selected',String(name===tab));$(pane).hidden=name!==tab}document.querySelector('.fileviews').hidden=tab!=='files';$('uploadFiles').hidden=tab!=='files';if(tab==='history'&&!historyJobs.length)loadPrintHistory();if(tab==='console')loadConsoleLog()}
function refreshFileTab(){if(fileTab==='history')loadPrintHistory(false);else if(fileTab==='console')loadConsoleLog();else loadFiles()}
const historyDate=s=>Number.isFinite(s)?new Date(s*1000).toLocaleString():'—';
function historyFilament(j){const m=j.metadata||{},grams=Number.isFinite(m.filament_weight_total)&&m.filament_total>0&&Number.isFinite(j.filament_used)?j.filament_used*m.filament_weight_total/m.filament_total:NaN;return Number.isFinite(grams)?number(grams,2)+' g · estimated':statsMeters(j.filament_used)}
function renderPrintHistory(){const query=$('historySearch').value.toLowerCase(),rows=historyJobs.filter(j=>(j.filename+' '+j.status).toLowerCase().includes(query));$('historyJobs').replaceChildren();if(!rows.length){text('historyJobs',historyJobs.length?'No matching jobs in loaded history.':'No print history recorded.')}for(const j of rows){const card=document.createElement('article');card.className='historyjob';const top=document.createElement('div');top.className='historyjobtop';if(j.exists){const thumb=document.createElement('button'),img=document.createElement('img');thumb.type='button';thumb.className='thumbnailpreview filethumbnail';thumb.setAttribute('aria-label','Preview history file '+j.filename);img.src=scoped('/api/thumbnail?filename='+encodeURIComponent(j.filename));img.alt='Print model';img.loading='lazy';img.onerror=()=>{thumb.hidden=true};thumb.append(img);thumb.onclick=()=>openPreview(j.filename);top.append(thumb)}const name=document.createElement('div');name.className='historyjobname';name.textContent=j.filename;const date=document.createElement('small');date.textContent=historyDate(j.start_time);name.append(date);const status=document.createElement('span');status.className='historystatus';status.dataset.status=j.status;status.textContent=(j.status||'unknown').replaceAll('_',' ');top.append(name,status);const metrics=document.createElement('div');metrics.className='historymetrics';for(const label of ['Print time: '+statsDuration(j.print_duration),'Total time: '+statsDuration(j.total_duration),'Filament: '+historyFilament(j)]){const span=document.createElement('span');span.textContent=label;metrics.append(span)}const log=document.createElement('details'),summary=document.createElement('summary'),dl=document.createElement('dl');summary.textContent='Job log';const entries=[['Job ID',j.job_id],['Result',(j.status||'unknown').replaceAll('_',' ')],['Started',historyDate(j.start_time)],['Finished',historyDate(j.end_time)],['Print duration',statsDuration(j.print_duration)],['Total duration',statsDuration(j.total_duration)],['Filament length',statsMeters(j.filament_used)],['Filament weight',historyFilament(j)],['File',j.exists?'Available on printer':'File no longer on printer']];for(const [label,value] of entries){const dt=document.createElement('dt'),dd=document.createElement('dd');dt.textContent=label;dd.textContent=value;dl.append(dt,dd)}log.append(summary,dl);card.append(top,metrics,log);if(j.exists){const print=document.createElement('button');print.className='start';iconLabel(print,'play','Print again');print.onclick=()=>selectPrintColors(j.filename);card.append(print)}$('historyJobs').append(card)}$('moreHistory').hidden=!historyMore;$('moreHistory').disabled=historyLoading;$('moreHistory').textContent=$('historyOrder').value==='desc'?'Load older jobs':'Load newer jobs';buttons()}
async function loadPrintHistory(append=false){const id=selectedPrinter,epoch=++historyRequestEpoch,offset=append?historyOffset:0;historyLoading=true;$('moreHistory').disabled=true;text('historyMessage','Loading print history…');try{const d=await request('/api/history?start='+offset+'&order='+$('historyOrder').value);if(id!==selectedPrinter||epoch!==historyRequestEpoch)return;historyJobs=append?[...historyJobs,...d.jobs]:d.jobs;historyOffset=offset+d.jobs.length;historyMore=d.has_more;historyLoading=false;renderPrintHistory();text('historyMessage',historyJobs.length+' jobs loaded · '+($('historyOrder').value==='desc'?'Newest first':'Oldest first'))}catch(e){if(id===selectedPrinter&&epoch===historyRequestEpoch){historyLoading=false;text('historyMessage','Could not load history: '+e.message);$('moreHistory').disabled=false}}}
async function loadConsoleLog(){const id=selectedPrinter,epoch=++consoleRequestEpoch;text('consoleMessage','Loading console log…');$('consoleEntries').replaceChildren();try{const d=await request('/api/console-log');if(id!==selectedPrinter||epoch!==consoleRequestEpoch)return;const rows=[...(d.gcode_store||[])].reverse();for(const item of rows){const row=document.createElement('div'),date=document.createElement('time'),message=document.createElement('pre');row.className='consoleentry';row.dataset.type=item.type;date.textContent=Number.isFinite(item.time)?new Date(item.time*1000).toLocaleTimeString():'—';message.textContent=item.message;row.append(date,message);$('consoleEntries').append(row)}text('consoleMessage',rows.length?'Last '+rows.length+' console entries · newest first · Click Refresh to update':'No console entries yet.')}catch(e){if(id===selectedPrinter&&epoch===consoleRequestEpoch)text('consoleMessage','Could not load console log: '+e.message)}}
$('filesTab').onclick=()=>setFileTab('files');$('historyTab').onclick=()=>setFileTab('history');$('consoleTab').onclick=()=>setFileTab('console');$('historySearch').oninput=renderPrintHistory;$('historyOrder').onchange=()=>loadPrintHistory();$('moreHistory').onclick=()=>loadPrintHistory(true);
for(const [index,name] of ['files','history','console'].entries())$(name+'Tab').onkeydown=e=>{if(!['ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','Home','End'].includes(e.key))return;e.preventDefault();const target=e.key==='Home'?0:e.key==='End'?2:(index+(e.key==='ArrowRight'?1:2))%3;const next=['files','history','console'][target];setFileTab(next);$(next+'Tab').focus()};

if(document.querySelector('meta[name=public-access]')?.content==='1'){const logout=document.createElement('button');logout.textContent='Sign out';logout.onclick=async()=>{await fetch('/api/logout',{method:'POST',headers:{'X-Control-Token':token}});location.reload()};document.querySelector('.headeractions').append(logout)}
